data: {"id": "ff709e668ad64dc9-thinking-parallel_evidence-269", "run_id": "ff709e668ad64dc9", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集到的事实：\n- Pod 状态: Running 但 containersNotReady (CrashLoopBackOff, restarts=15, exitCode=78)\n- Events: 54m 内 BackOff 221 次\n- Previous logs: 显示 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误，http_status=500，路径 `/work`\n\n这组日志来自容器启动后运行期间的 HTTP 请求，不是进程崩溃前的日志。Exit Code=78 通常是应用配置缺失导致的退出。我需要进一步确认：\n1. 当前运行中的容器日志（看是否仍有 CONFIG_MISSING 错误）\n2. 更深入的 previous logs 或 describe 中的 Last State 信息\n\n让我继续采集更多信息。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789075515534, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

